## Hypothesis about the bug:
- (Current hypothesis) The encodeBase64String method is causing unexpected line breaks in the Base64 encoded output because it calls encodeBase64 with the isChunked parameter set to true. This results in the output being chunked into 76 character blocks, which is not expected by the failing test cases. The solution might be to set the isChunked parameter to false in the encodeBase64String method.

